        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In addition to the holidays listed above, an employee may observe a special or religious holiday, if the University determines that work schedules permit, by charging time off to accrued overtime, accrued vacation or leave without pay. Requests for such observation shall be granted on the basis of operational needs and requirements and shall not be denied unreasonably.",
